            <characteristic name="Morale" typeId="char-morale">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Arcane" typeId="char-arcane">6</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Wargear" id="8e84-b449-d86a-7c66" hidden="false">
          <selectionEntryGroups>
            <selectionEntryGroup name="Ranged Weapon" id="c20c-ee78-9ea3-ec4e" hidden="false">
              <selectionEntries>
                <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Staff of Torment" hidden="false" id="a089-53f1-acb5-47f6" defaultAmount="1" sortIndex="1">
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Staff of Torment" typeId="f94b-6526-ad27-3051" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false" id="0bd6-3b2a-55f8-4757">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="1023-f0db-ffcf-da31">24&quot;</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="1192-2222-5926-5b4b">-</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="ff5b-347b-c7f0-5770">-</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="a482-225f-a3cb-a700">-</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="76cd-5882-86da-52cf">This counts as a *psychic* attack, and can only target visible *infantry* units which include two or more models within 24”. When a unit with this weapon makes a Shoot action, instead of making an attack as normal, select a target unit and resolve the following effect:
The acting player rolls a number of dice equal to the number of models in the target unit, adding 1 to the roll for each attrition point allocated to the target unit.
For each roll of a 10+, a model in the target unit is reduced by terror to a delirious wreck, and is slain.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Icon of the Deceiver" hidden="false" id="f014-001f-9579-2c61" sortIndex="2">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="Auri" typeId="cost-auri" value="10"/>
                  </costs>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Icon of the Deceiver" typeId="f94b-6526-ad27-3051" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false" id="0569-0fec-f05f-2197">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="1023-f0db-ffcf-da31">24&quot;</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="1192-2222-5926-5b4b">-</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="ff5b-347b-c7f0-5770">-</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="a482-225f-a3cb-a700">-</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="76cd-5882-86da-52cf">This counts as a *psychic* attack, and can only target visible *infantry* units which include two or more models within 24”. When a unit with this weapon makes a Shoot action, instead of making an attack as normal, select a target unit and resolve the following effect:
Each player rolls a dice, adding their respective units’ Morale characteristic to their roll.
If the acting player’s total is higher, the target unit is temporarily overcome by visions of their fellow warriors as enemies, and attacks them. The targeted player selects half the number of models in the target unit and resolves an attack with them, as if they were making a Fight action, against the rest of their unit as if they were an enemy unit. Subtract 2 from attack rolls made as a result of this effect.
This effect does not prevent the target unit from making other actions during this phase.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Infernal Totem" hidden="false" id="268c-fefc-d8be-c0ac" sortIndex="3">
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Infernal Totem" typeId="f94b-6526-ad27-3051" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false" id="a951-ef6c-d866-1573">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="1023-f0db-ffcf-da31">18&quot;</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="1192-2222-5926-5b4b">8</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="ff5b-347b-c7f0-5770">+3</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="a482-225f-a3cb-a700">3</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="76cd-5882-86da-52cf">Attacks made with this weapon count as *psychic* attacks.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="Auri" typeId="cost-auri" value="15"/>
                  </costs>
                </selectionEntry>
              </selectionEntries>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="11f7-cdea-faab-995b-min" includeChildSelections="false"/>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="11f7-cdea-faab-995b-max" includeChildSelections="false"/>
