      <rules>
        <rule name="The World Reborn In Fire" id="159b-12ab-87f1-98cc" hidden="false">
          <description>This unit is immune to the effects of any weapons and abilities with the words ‘fire’, ‘inferno’, ‘blaze’ and ‘incinerate’ (or derivatives of those words) in their names, and attack rolls made as part of the Redemption in Death ability are made with disadvantage. In addition, each time this unit makes a successful charge, its charge target gains one additional attrition point.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
