      <rules>
        <rule name="The Ruinous Gong - Aura (6&quot;)" id="ff61-e42f-6045-0d9f" hidden="false">
          <description>When this unit, or any unit grouped with it, destroys an enemy unit, this unit creates a *void echo* until the end of the combat phase.
At the end of each combat phase, roll a dice for each unit within 6” of one or more *void echo* units. If the roll is less than or equal to the number of attrition points allocated to that unit, that unit gains a number of additional attrition points equivalent to the number of *void echo* and *resonance* units on the battlefield.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
