      <rules>
        <rule name="Voidborn Horror" id="160f-b33f-9903-6131" hidden="false">
          <description>Non-*psychic* attacks have disadvantage when targeting this unit while the attacking unit is within 6” of it. This unit never accumulates attrition points, unless they would be inflicted by a *Dæmon* or *Consecrated* unit.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Blood and Death and Gore and Murder" id="52dc-edd9-7609-a308" hidden="false">
          <description>This unit’s strength characteristics and attack rolls can never be modified (except by attrition points), and enemy units cannot mitigate any successful attack rolls made by this unit by any means.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="No Master But Hunger" id="0087-4f09-b586-f4bf" hidden="false">
          <description>If, at the end of any phase, all *leaders* in a Kingdoms of *Mikaelhelde* force containing this unit are slain, from the beginning of the following turn until the end of the battle this unit becomes a Neutral Hunter (see Neutral Units in the Core Rulebook for details).</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
