      <rules>
        <rule name="Blood And Slaughter" id="4434-3a70-e012-04a9" hidden="false">
          <description>Once per turn, when this unit makes a successful charge, it can immediately attack with its blade ram as if it were the combat phase. If it destroys the unit it charged with that attack, it can choose to immediately make another charge move action if any other enemy units are within 10” of it (but when doing so, do not add half of its speed characteristic to its charge distance).</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
