        <profile name="Blade of Severance" typeId="2857-5ab3-db0f-64a1" typeName="Melee Weapon" hidden="false" id="7ebd-0836-320c-3da3">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="e736-f6b3-0474-ddb8">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="9a62-cd45-d844-0bc3">+5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="2780-b560-1641-b9a5">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="1977-0f4d-9e75-2e2d">Attacks from this weapon count as *psychic* *destroyer* attacks, and natural attack rolls of 9+ made with this weapon inflict Critical Hits.
Models slain by this weapon are ontologically annihilated and cannot be resurrected by any means, and any abilities which would add models to a unit as a result of other models being slain do not take effect if those models were slain by this weapon.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <costs>
        <cost name="Auri" typeId="cost-auri" value="185"/>
      </costs>
      <rules>
        <rule name="For I Have Witnessed What Awaits In The Void" id="cbed-662e-64f2-7409" hidden="false">
          <description>This unit can never accumulate attrition points, regardless of any damage inflicted upon it or any abilities that would allocate attrition points.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="A Testament Of Slaughter" id="77cb-39b0-f2ea-e0d3" hidden="false">
          <description>Successful hits made by this model can be allocated to models in a target unit by the attacking player, rather than by the target unit’s controlling player (even if models in that unit are already injured). Such attacks can also be allocated to *independent* units in a group, even if there are three or models in its retinue.
At the end of each Movement Phase, any enemy units visible to and within 6” of this unit gain a number of attrition points equal to the number of *leader* units it has slain.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
