      </costs>
      <rules>
        <rule name="The Collector - Resurrection" id="746b-bf31-c00c-4892" hidden="false">
          <description>When a group including this unit finishes a Fight action, for each enemy *infantry* model that was slain, any models in the group’s retinue unit which are below their starting health characteristic heal one point of health. If all of the retinue unit’s models are at their starting health, for every three enemy *infantry* models slain, one model from this group’s retinue that was slain earlier in the battle is resurrected with their full health.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
