    <profile name="Infernal Maul" typeId="2857-5ab3-db0f-64a1" typeName="Melee Weapon" hidden="false" id="9a3e-c543-9e1b-99e9">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="e736-f6b3-0474-ddb8">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="9a62-cd45-d844-0bc3">+4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="2780-b560-1641-b9a5">4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="1977-0f4d-9e75-2e2d">After a unit equipped with this weapon has finished attacking, for each *infantry* model slain by this weapon, make one additional attack roll. These additional attacks, should they slay more models, do not generate additional attacks.
Each time a unit gains an attrition point as part of an attack that includes this weapon, it gains one additional attrition point.</characteristic>
